    "Q7.2": "balance",
    "Q8.1": "Part-time students (e.g., commuting or caring for family) may be excluded from current ‘course credit’ models if not monitored through Absalon—propose tracking *specific* part-time study patterns alongside credits. Also, consider linking absalon data to *universal support hubs* rather than just academic advisors.",
